VP8 for the VA driver (debian-livecd-termux): CODEC_VP8_ENC (14), the VP8
encoder in <socket>.encoders, hardware VP8 decoders in <socket>.decoders, and
no codec-config buffer forwarded for VP8 encoders (as for VP9).

Encoder output: AMediaCodec_getOutputBuffer already points at the buffer's
range offset, so info.offset is not added again (encoder and decoder output). OMX.qcom.video.encoder.vp8
reports offset 12, and adding it cut the first 12 bytes of every frame.

